	<key>%lld files will be moved to the Trash (a RAW+JPEG pair counts as two), totaling about %@. Undo with ⌘Z before closing this session, while files remain in Trash. Emptying Trash permanently deletes them and may free that space.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%1$#@count1@</string>
		<key>count1</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%2$@ file will be moved to the Trash (a RAW+JPEG pair counts as two), totaling about %3$@. Undo with ⌘Z before closing this session, while files remain in Trash. Emptying Trash permanently deletes them and may free that space.</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%2$@ files will be moved to the Trash (a RAW+JPEG pair counts as two), totaling about %3$@. Undo with ⌘Z before closing this session, while files remain in Trash. Emptying Trash permanently deletes them and may free that space.</string>
		</dict>
